"card"><div class="card-heading"><h2>Whispers</h2></div><p class="empty">${game.arcana===0?'They say a hedge-witch lives beyond the old mill. The duke has posted a notice for anyone brave enough to visit.':'The weave hums beneath the world. You have only begun to listen.'}</p><button class="option" data-tab="arcana"><span class="option-icon">✧</span><span><strong>Seek the arcane</strong><small>There is more to learn.</small></span><span class="price">↗</span></button></section></aside></div>`}
